Freelance Account Executive/ Senior Account Executive&nbsp; - Ogilvy PR (Consumer PR &amp; Influence) &nbsp;

Freelance | Full-time availability required | November - December 2026 &nbsp;

&nbsp;

We’re looking for a switched-on, hands-on Freelance AE/SAE to join our Consumer team at Ogilvy PR during the Christmas period. &nbsp;

This is a great opportunity for someone who thrives on getting things done, has strong media relations skills, and can confidently manage the day-to-day needs of client accounts. &nbsp;

We need a proactive, organised and highly capable PR professional who can hit the ground running and provide support across media outreach, campaign execution, and account management. &nbsp;

&nbsp;

About The Role:

Working as part of our PR &amp; Influence team, you’ll play a key role in delivering media activity during the festive season, helping keep campaigns moving and ensuring our clients and media contacts are well looked after. &nbsp;

You’ll be a natural doer who is comfortable rolling up your sleeves, building media relationships, pitching stories, and managing multiple priorities in a fast-paced agency environment. You’ll be available for some weekend work and work during the Holidays, as part of supporting a high-profile client to activate during this pivotal festive period. &nbsp;

&nbsp;

