• Driving proactive media relations, including developing media lists, pitching stories, following up with journalists and securing coverage. &nbsp;

• Supporting the execution of consumer PR campaigns, activations, and announcements.

• Managing day-to-day account activity, including timelines, status reports, coverage reports, and client communications.

• Building and maintaining strong relationships with journalists, editors, influencers, and other relevant media contacts.

• Identifying timely news hooks and opportunities to generate coverage for clients.

• Providing hands-on support to the wider team and confidently managing competing deadlines.

